  "summary": "Software developer with over 3 years of professional experience building and maintaining mission critical systems in the defense industry. My main focus is in C++ development, low-level Linux programming, and infrastructure automation. My strength lies in building robust, scalable systems and diving deep into debugging complex issues.\n\nIn addition to development I take the lead on system integration. My responsibilities include making sure all pieces of software, including 3rd party solutions, all seamlessly work together. That includes diagnosing cross-system issues, coordinating with other teams, and traveling onsite to support integration efforts.\n\nCurrently looking for new opportunities where I can contribute to high-impact systems and continue growing as an engineer. I value teams that prioritize clean architecture and continuous learning.",
